{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891150/extras/22.png?t=1744883278\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DLC \u201cNightmares of Millenis\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuation of Knock on the Coffin Lid's story, after the game's finale.Will you manage to pass all of Millenis\u2019 tests and find the one right decision that will allow you to stop the war in the lands of Midian?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TAROT CARDS AND ADJUSTABLE DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real masters of the rogue-like genre can defy fate in the new endgame mode &quot;Millenis Nightmares&quot;.After completing main game's story seven Tarot cards with unique gameplay conditions will be available for each of the heroes. Compete with other travelers to become first in the ranking of the best players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NEW PLOT TWIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the main game you learned the fates and life missions of Persival, Bjorn, and Vanadis. It\u2019s time to walk the roads of Midian once again and find out what new surprises Mortis and Millenis have prepared for our heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891150/extras/TaroCards_-_eng.gif?t=1744883278\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891150/extras/11.png?t=1744883278\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891150?t=1744883278","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891150?t=1744883278","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891150/62028a63cdd7f9bf089fbc0a5196cb802da92229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744883278","ca